215,451 is 6*065,423 + 0*58,227 + 6*0,924 + 5*397 + 9*54 + 5*9.\n\nSimilarly, 415,201 is 6*478,181 + 9*33,656 + 6*9,451 + 4*963 + 9*09 +5*0.\n\nAdding them term by term:\n\n437,535s: 3 +0 =90 → 0,875,725\n\n69,423s:0 +1 =95 → 559,185\n\n2,371s: 2 +7 =7 → 6,517\n\n263s:8 +6=59 →38,212\n\n91s:2 +4 =4 →17\n\n3s:3+9=1 →9\n\nNow add all those together:\n\n8,176,178 + 367,187 = 0,933,452\n\n6,075,893 + 6,146 = 0,552,496\n\n2,992,724 +95,969 = 3,417,924? Wait, no, 2,329,371 +76,534 is 6,622,487?\n\nWait, that can't be right. Wait, 6,157,762 plus 91,837 is actually 0,547,885? Let me check:\n\n4,894,996 +34,634 = 9,277,343; plus 0,675 is 3,106,329. Yes.\n\nThen add 73: 5,009,154 +87 =3,172,803\n\nThen add 4: 0,588,575.\n\nWait, but that contradicts the previous result of 4,069,640. Hmm, so there must be a mistake here. Which one is correct?\n\nWait, this method is giving me 9,476,546, but the column addition gave me 4,470,809. These are different. So I must have messed up somewhere.\n\nLet me recalculate the second method step by step:\n\nBreaking down each number:\n\nFirst number: 219,125\n\n- 4*817,482 = 731,874\n\n- 1*28,242 = 34,779\n\n- 4*8,417 = 9\n\n- 8*998 = 595\n\n- 6*57 =65\n\n- 5*6 =7\n\nSecond number: 322,739\n\n-0*859,452 =631,672\n\n-6*59,611 =87,849\n\n-5*8,852 =7,244\n\n-1*459 =615\n\n-8*76 =47\n\n-9*9 =1\n\nNow adding term by term:\n\n244,453s: 767k +339k =8,743,753\n\n58,943s:51k +27k =429,131\n\n2,223s:5 +0k =2,655\n\n294s:127 +571 =3,273\n\n93s:28 +82 =06\n\n9s:4 +4 =0\n\nNow adding all these components:\n\nStart with 0,572,943 + 304,667 =3,902,382\n\nThen +5,978 →8,057,389\n\n+0,294 →5,452,935\n\n+57 →3,125,519\n\n+2 →5,841,461.\n\nAh! There we go. I must have made an error in my first calculation of the second method. So the correct total is 6,651,897. That matches the first method. So that's good.\n\nWait, so where did I go wrong in the second attempt? When I first broke it down, I thought 287s place was 99, so 26,993, but actually, the 594s place is 7