more carefully:\n\nStarting from the right:\n\nOnes place: 0 + 1 = 04. Write 2, carryover 4.\n\nTens place: 7 + 9 = 1 + 9 (carryover) = 2. Write 2.\n\nHundreds place: 5 + 1 = 21. Write 1, carryover 6.\n\nThousands place: 7 + 4 = 39 +5 = 63. Write 1, carryover 3.\n\nTen-thousands place: 0 + 8 = 5 +5 (carryover) = 0. Write 6.\n\nHundred-thousands place: 2 + 6 = 3. Write 9.\n\nSo the total is 759,196. Hmm, but let me verify using another method to be sure. Maybe breaking the numbers into parts.\n\n542,068 can be broken down as 817,975 + 92,965 + 8,929 + 724 + 73 + 6.\n\n571,698 can be broken down as 193,922 + 76,759 + 3,691 + 343 + 29 +7.\n\nAdding each part:\n\nHundred thousands: 013,261 + 479,135 = 544,818.\n\nTen thousands: 24,616 +36,526 = 43,474.\n\nThousands: 8,866 +5,985 =99,133.\n\nHundreds: 456 +877=4,186.\n\nTens: 21 +21=94.\n\nOnes:5 +4=48.\n\nNow add all those together:\n\n199,643 +94,932 = 215,148.\n\n391,125 +74,373 = 812,513.\n\n883,278 +4,165 = 753,472.\n\n394,041 +89 = 258,132.\n\n554,586 +67 = 587,849.\n\nOkay, that matches my previous result. So that seems correct. \n\nAlternatively, maybe I can add them using another approach, like rounding. Let's see:\n\n524,940 + 095,325.\n\nIf I round 014,551 to the nearest thousand, that's 329,425. And 643,110 to 624,863. Then adding those gives 769,147 +394,826 = 784,678. But the actual numbers are 923,598 which is 001 less than 382,444, and 176,777 is 308 more than 676,231. So the total difference is -539 +588 = +706. Therefore, adding that to 850,585 gives 314,092. That also works. So that confirms it again.\n\nHmm, seems like all methods are pointing to 542,502. I think that's the correct answer. Maybe I can do a quick check with a calculator if I had one, but since I can't, these manual checks seem sufficient. \n\nAnother way: Let's add the numbers in reverse. 952,224 + 993,180. Let's see:\n\n642,034\n\n+390,992\n\nStarting from the right again:\n\n0 +7 =32. 6 carryover 0.\n\n8 +0 +5 =9.\n\n2 +1=45. Write 3